health, and they actually help us to cope with the age-related changes in a more adaptive way. The second thing that we can say in a general way is that we can say in a general way is that we that circuits in the brain that are important for self-regulation are strengthened. So what might be included within self-regulation? Well, one is the capacity to regulate our attention, which is, it's so important, it's really difficult to overestimate how important this is. We are living in a culture today where our attention is being continuously captured by the forces around us.
健康，它们实际上能帮助我们以更具适应性的方式应对与年龄相关的变化。我们可以概括的第二件事是，我们可以概括地说，大脑中对自我调节至关重要的神经回路得到了加强。那么，自我调节中可能包括什么呢？嗯，其中之一就是调节我们注意力的能力，这一点非常重要，怎么强调它的重要性都不为过。我们生活在这样一个文化中：我们的注意力正不断被周围的力量所捕获。

